{"title":"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(basically_solution_3_but_with_steps_and_a_quicker_conclusion)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (basically solution 3 but with steps and a quicker conclusion)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For all <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integers</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/a/79a0762fa67aa3a9484c36995f9da9712690cf88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = \\frac{1}{\\log_n 2002}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"117\" height=\"41\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/4/304f1e040ccd68d5dc60d8fc9606e4ee09fb8a72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = a_2 + a_3 + a_4 + a_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"165\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/b/5fbb91320776a260faf7b908f1c1627084f01956.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a_{10} + a_{11} + a_{12} + a_{13} + a_{14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"238\" height=\"13\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/3/953845363a851f083dcb07b81306d0d7a879f838.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b- c$\" width=\"38\" height=\"12\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/2/45206f948cd7bbb6452b1653d7e795667e461a81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ -2 \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ -1  \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\frac{1}{2002} \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{1001} \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\frac 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"452\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithms#Logarithmic_Properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Logarithms\">change of base</a> formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720918cfa93fc9a5b9907dadd3df17c3d6436c3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = \\frac{1}{\\frac{\\log 2002}{\\log n}} = \\left(\\frac{1}{\\log 2002}\\right) \\log n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"254\" height=\"48\" />. Thus \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/5/cd5e8a06433c143b797a032b03b8a8cceac18a32.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}b- c &amp;= \\left(\\frac{1}{\\log 2002}\\right)(\\log 2 + \\log 3 + \\log 4 + \\log 5 - \\log 10 - \\log 11 - \\log 12 - \\log 13 - \\log 14)\\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\frac{1}{\\log 2002}\\right)\\left(\\log \\frac{2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 4 \\cdot 5}{10 \\cdot 11 \\cdot 12 \\cdot 13 \\cdot 14}\\right)\\\\  &amp;= \\left(\\frac{1}{\\log 2002}\\right) \\log 2002^{-1} = -\\left(\\frac{\\log 2002}{\\log 2002}\\right) = -1 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(B)}\\end{align*}\" width=\"713\" height=\"142\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28basically_solution_3_but_with_steps_and_a_quicker_conclusion.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(basically_solution_3_but_with_steps_and_a_quicker_conclusion)\">Solution 2 (basically solution 3 but with steps and a quicker conclusion)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (basically solution 3 but with steps and a quicker conclusion)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that \\( \\frac{1}{\\log_a(b)} = \\log_b(a) \\). Therefore, \\( \\frac{1}{\\log_n(2002)} = \\log_{2002}(n) \\). For the sake of space and time, set \\( a = 2002 \\). Then \\( b \\) can be represented as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dcdb7827ef0a2fd2b32e02c02416da02d06c1b6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_a(2) + \\log_a(3) + \\log_a(4) + \\log_a(5)\\]\" width=\"283\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/9/7d941a5e8bf4c096c04ced6081f056b71d389e23.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{which is simply}\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/3/0d38f689f8cb6710fe86a142e4fcba28cc8ddbd8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_a(2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 4 \\cdot 5)\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27fe44be9e50df25a36101f60d872fe6673f486f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{and } c \\text{ can be represented as}\\]\" width=\"201\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/3/133457b65346a1da6a2110f0a06d31cb0bb8f288.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_a(10) + \\log_a(11) + \\log_a(12) + \\log_a(13) + \\log_a(14)\\]\" width=\"405\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/9/7d941a5e8bf4c096c04ced6081f056b71d389e23.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{which is simply}\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/2/f32a5844656e69b863c75600b110c74341aec515.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_a(10 \\cdot 11 \\cdot 12 \\cdot 13 \\cdot 14)\\]\" width=\"186\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/5/675ee2016a397aef14628f6d92e601622b33b7a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{so } b - c \\text{ is just}\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/b/67be64885e245c8ecfba737d97ce9931c39c287f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_a(2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 4 \\cdot 5) - \\log_a(10 \\cdot 11 \\cdot 12 \\cdot 13 \\cdot 14)\\]\" width=\"330\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/9/7d941a5e8bf4c096c04ced6081f056b71d389e23.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{which is simply}\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/e/ace0957739f85d12d1be35f72468b089f12111d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_a\\left(\\frac{2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 4 \\cdot 5}{10 \\cdot 11 \\cdot 12 \\cdot 13 \\cdot 14}\\right)\\]\" width=\"204\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/7/ed748d15ea9de34b1afaf8ddf810cbedece4f122.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{or}\\]\" width=\"15\" height=\"8\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/e/ecef9939f02725c7d4c27aba19c54473e3e81e99.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_a\\left(\\frac{1}{2002}\\right)\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/9/ba99c16693af9ebf786ceedf1706ab3cf1d648d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{but } a = 2002, \\text{ so we have}\\]\" width=\"191\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/3/a23ae65c3709e5688986cfee4a9b800f0bf95e9e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{2002}\\left(\\frac{1}{2002}\\right)\\]\" width=\"116\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd4414a9f6f7c914e308ea141d60fbfec146042.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}-1}\\]\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfcd35f7fe5fb3e56e6a0243861dbb45e245f7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\log_a b}=\\log_b a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"113\" height=\"41\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/b/d9b886b4fd6ff66ab6eb6b5ca960086cdee1cd3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=\\log_{2002} n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"17\" />. Also notice that if we have a log sum, we multiply, and if we have a log product, we divide. Using these properties, we get that the result is the following:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/9/199b6d891f518c6a7a5b91a927f66ce5a7662845.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{2002}\\left(\\frac{2*3*4*5}{10*11*12*13*14}=\\frac{1}{11*13*14}=\\frac{1}{2002}\\right)=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}-1}\\]\" width=\"520\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>~yofro\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/0/9e0e606d8cff59842ef4dfe59d5b3b355c2c2a12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2 = \\frac{1}{\\log_2 2002}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"117\" height=\"43\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is also equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/1/fa1814784c8faa27549007480b3ebb5e2a14b694.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/a/bba170c6bd647ce931c5fe29b18f29957f32ccb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2 = \\frac{\\log_2 2}{\\log_2 2002}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"117\" height=\"44\" />. By the change of bases formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/0/4d0b827ddffca99c35976bad11c7c4f48f4254ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_2 = \\log_{2002} 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"19\" />. Following the same reasoning, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/9/33917d98e21f9f94624029f34a7387e72b95118b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_3 = \\log_{2002} 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/33545e8c50c8a829827183182f10418d747e7837.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_4 = \\log_{2002} 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"19\" /> and so on.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311d7b322cb9b87d3679318e60552b5f88169228.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b = \\log_{2002} 2 + \\log_{2002} 3 + .....+ \\log_{2002} 5 = \\log_{2002} 5! = \\log_{2002} 120\\]\" width=\"484\" height=\"17\" />\nNow solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, we see that it equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6bcfb1e6e625cdda30b9b7e12576a46abf4bc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2002} (10\\cdot 11 \\cdot 12 \\cdot 13 \\cdot 14)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"210\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/4/b54e7d72385cda0ab092c518c816da504aff3d06.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b-c = \\log_{2002} 120 - \\log_{2002} 240240 \\rightarrow \\log_{2002} \\frac{1}{2002} = \\boxed{-1}\\]\" width=\"455\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>~YBSuburbanTea\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B\">2002 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017174909\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 300/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8140/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.245      1 -total\n 58.31%    7.723      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 39.93%    5.288      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6289:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017174909 and revision id 270409. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}